- this directory contains the skeleton for part 3 of the simple regex
  "compile a regex to an FSM and do matching using that"

- Files include:

makefsm.[ch]:	RE to FSM convertor module - skeleton for you to complete
testmakefsm.c:	Unit test program for makefsm module
match.[ch]:	pattern matching using FSMs module
searchstr.c:	main program that uses regex ADT, parsing, constructing a FSM
		and running it to match a regex against a string
.cbuild:	Custom CB config file to compile the main programs
		and link each against makefsm.o and match.o here, along with
		the (sample solution) regex.o and checkregex.o
		from the support library.

- we also depend on ../lib/*, look in there for (eg) regex.h and token.h and
  everything else provided..
